{"chunk": 0, "s": 402.4, "e": 406.8, "t": " कराज अ दी तो दीन अद्यन्त थाबावे,", "w": []}
{"chunk": 0, "s": 436.8, "e": 442.08, "t": " ॐ ौlha purabhiksheshinir malanadithunga", "w": []}
{"chunk": 0, "s": 442.08, "e": 449.08, "t": " ॐ jallaprasheep nithra mahuradeshi aesai iba", "w": []}
